[quote]"[JSawyer] will probably conflict with some of your 10,000 other mods. Sorry." - Joshua Sawyer[/quote]
[size=6][b]Description[/b][/size]
JSawyerless is an incrementally adoptable reimplementation of JSawyer. Choose the individual changes you want as small, focused mods, many of them ESPless.

[b]This mod is a work in progress![/b] Some changes in the original JSawyer mod are not yet implemented.
[size=6][b]Purpose[/b][/size]
I believe that a properly curated mod list should avoid overrides and conflicts, that mods should focus on one feature, and that configuration should be limited to personal preferences.

Many of JSawyer's changes are already covered or superseded by other mods. JSawyerless lets you install the remaining features individually. The goal is lightweight mods without conflicts or configuration, using scripts and patchers wherever possible. Some features still require ESPs; these are listed in the technical details section below.
[size=6][b]Included features[/b][/size]
Each feature contains changes from JSawyer. The full changelog of the original JSawyer mod is available here: [url=https://fallout.wiki/wiki/Mod:JSawyer/Documentation]JSawyer Documentation - The Fallout Wiki[/url].
