[spoiler][size=4][b]Barton the Wasteland Tech Salvager[/b][/size]
[size=3][b]Changes:[/b][/size]
[list]
[*]Barton Thorn's class is now JSawyerWastelandTechSalvager, with Energy Weapons tagged.[/*]
[*]Replaces the 9mm Pistol and 9mm ammunition on Barton's base form with a Plasma Pistol and Energy Cells.[/*]
[*][undocumented] adjusts Barton Thorn's base actor values[/*]
[/list]
