[size=6][b]Installation and requirements[/b][/size]
[b]JSawyer is not required.[/b]
Install with your mod manager and follow the FOMOD:
[list=1]
[*]Select whether [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/newvegas/mods/51664]YUP[/url], [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/newvegas/mods/98681]STARS[/url], and [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/newvegas/mods/83937]SPARE[/url] are installed.[/*]
[*]Choose the Content, Balance, and Fix features you want.[/*]
[*]Install the requirements listed for your selected features.[/*]
[/list]
[size=6][b]Technical details[/b][/size]
[size=5][b]ESPless where possible[/b][/size]
I have implemented as many changes as possible without an ESP. The current installer includes ten ESP-backed components, counting the automatically installed Wasteland Tech Salvager Class. Only the components selected or required by your choices are installed.
[spoiler][list]
[*][b]Wasteland Tech Salvager Class:[/b] Requires an ESP for the class.[/*]
[*][b]Barton the Wasteland Tech Salvager:[/b] Requires an ESP to override Barton's class. A suitable NVSE function for changing an actor's base class could remove this override, but the class itself would still require an ESP.[/*]
[*][b]Deranged Bright Followers:[/b] Requires an ESP for the NPCs and placed references. I am considering integration through [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/newvegas/mods/97670]Dynamic Encounters - Map Accurate Ambushes[/url].[/*]
[*][b]GRA Weapon Leveled Items:[/b] Requires an ESP for the new WithAmmo forms.[/*]
[*][b]I Never Axed For This:[/b] Requires an ESP for the challenge and perk.[/*]
[*][b]Junk Rounds:[/b] Requires an ESP for ammunition and recipes.[/*]
[*][b]Unique Armors:[/b] Requires an ESP for Commando Armor.[/*]
[*][b]Vending Machine Microfusion Cells:[/b] Requires an ESP for the note, placed reference, and recipe.[/*]
[*][b]NPC Caravan Decks:[/b] Requires an ESP to override the cards in the decks. A suitable NVSE function for adding cards to base decks could make this ESPless.[/*]
[*][b]Vending Machine .357 Magnum Rounds:[/b] Requires an ESP to move the recipe note. A suitable NVSE function to set reference positions could make this ESPless.[/*]
[/list]
Recipes are a possible candidate for [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/newvegas/mods/96846]recipes - Recipe Loader[/url] by [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/profile/StealthDick]StealthDick[/url], once the issues blocking its use here are resolved. New ammunition, notes, and other records would still need an ESP.[/spoiler]
